# Local machine and generated state; historical APKs and design originals stay versioned.
.DS_Store
.engineering/
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/.kotlin/
**/local.properties
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.idea/
.vscode/
.codex/
.agents/
!/.agents/
.agents/*
!.agents/skills/
.agents/skills/*
!.agents/skills/intake/
!.agents/skills/feature/
!.agents/skills/bugfix/
!.agents/skills/review/
